u near Ueno . The price here is 550 yen for adults . Remember to bring your own towel. Yes , let’s get ready to go in and take a bath. Let’s go. Minmin. Let’s go. Ah, I can’t go into Fumi. I’ve been waiting for you for a long time. President, I feel very tired. I need to soak a little longer. What do you think about my first time bathing [...] I won’t be able to record it for everyone , so... I’d like to say sorry to everyone first , and I’m about to leave . It was so scary in my imagination. Are my bangs still there? ? ? There is also Don Quixote next to it. Remember to use our coupons to get tax free and get 7% off. Like it . What's going on now? It's quite fun. Have you seen Mount Fuji? You can't see it at all because it's too fast. Are my bangs still there? I really recommend everyone to use the purple bottle of Cape's setting liquid. The roller coaster just came down so fast. I heard that its tilt angle is as high as 80 degrees. I'm so scared of this kind of vertical system . Now I have to go and rest first. Wait a minute. There is a shopping mall here. There is a row of gourmet restaurants in the back , and there are many\n\n4. 首頁 / 東京旅遊官方網站GO TOKYO\n   URL: https://www.gotokyo.org/tc/index.html\n   |  |  |  |  |  |  | 三社祭 |  |  |  |  |  |  | 深川八幡祭 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 歌舞伎 每月舉辦 |\n|  |  |  |  |  |  | 大相撲5月賽 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | 大相撲9月賽 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | 大相撲1月賽 |  |  |  |\n| 東京馬拉松2026 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | RAINBOW BRIDGE RIDE 2026 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  |  |  |  |  | SusHi Tech Tokyo 2026 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | Formula E Tokyo E-Prix2026 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | 第39屆東京國際影展 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | FASHION EVENT |  |  |  |  | Tokyo Tokyo Delicious Museum  連結為2026舉辦的活動 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | 東京美食節※2025 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | [...] + 伊豆群島・小笠原群島\n    - 大島\n    - 利島\n    - 新島\n    - 式根島\n 