                                             AIMessage(content="I now have enough information to compile a comprehensive research report. Let me verify the JR Pass national pricing with one more targeted search since it's critical for the Pass comparison, and confirm the Tokyo-Kyoto Shinkansen pricing.", additional_kwargs={'refusal': None}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 178, 'prompt_tokens': 85102, 'total_tokens': 85280, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': {'audio_tokens': None, 'cache_write_tokens': None, 'cached_tokens': 72960}, 'prompt_cache_hit_tokens': 72960, 'prompt_cache_miss_tokens': 12142}, 'model_provider': 'deepseek', 'model_name': 'deepseek-v4-flash', 'system_fingerprint': 'fp_a18b46594c_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402', 'id': '27ffab84-7058-4402-b9f4-a30e36ae8337', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None}, name='general-purpose', id='lc_run--019fe554-7fb6-7523-8ad2-1a2d7c27185d-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'search_travel_info', 'args': {'query': 'JR Pass 全国版 价格 7日 50000 14日 80000 21日 100000 日元 2024年10月'}, 'id': 'call_00_WlzoPMuPbIxoBAeIzNhF3674', 'type': 'tool_call'}, {'name': 'search_travel_info', 'args': {'query': '东京到京都 新干线 单程 指定席 约14000日元 自由席 约13000日元'}, 'id': 'call_01_TcXnProogWQW6o4hheSI5251', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 85102, 'output_tokens': 178, 'total_tokens': 85280, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 72960}, 'output_token_details': {}}),
                                             ToolMessage(content="1. Is Japan Rail Pass Worth Buying? (2025 Prices & Review) - Travel Caffeine\n   URL: https://www.travelcaffeine.com/japan-rail-pass-worth-money-tips\n   As you can see, JR introduced some truly massiveprice increases. The regular 7-day pass skyrocketed from JPY 29,650 to JPY 50,000, the 14-day pass increased from JPY 47,250 to JPY 80,000, and the 21-day pass went up the most “modest” amount, from JPY 60,450 to JPY 100,000. That last one is “only” a 65% increase, whereas the weeklong and two-week passes shoot up 70%.\n\nDespite this massive price increase, the fastest Nozomi trains on the Tokaido/Sanyo Shinkansen and the Mizuho trains on the Sanyo/Kyushu Shinkansen still are not included in the base Japan Rail Pass. What is changing is that JR is offering an additional special ticket that can be purchased to upgrade to the Nozomi and Mizuho services. [...] Before we get to the nitty gritty of the review, we should probably start with basics. The Japan Rail Pass for foreigner visitors is an economical “all inclusive” pass on the JR rail lines available for purchase outside of Japan at a discount.\n\nThe JR Pass allows visitors unlimited travel for 7, 14, or 21 days via the JR lines. There are also two versions of the JR Pass: the more expensive Green pass, and less expensive Ordinary one (we always buy the latter—more on that below).\n\nHere’s current 2025 pricing for the Japan Rail Pass, which will probably be valid for 2025 and 2026:\n\n7-Day Japan Rail Pass\n\n Adult: 50,000 yen\n Child: 25,000 yen\n Adult: 70,000 (Green)\n Child: 35,000 (Green)\n\n14-Day Japan Rail Pass [...] 14-Day Japan Rail Pass\n\n Adult: 80,000 yen\n Child: 40,000 yen\n Adult: 110,000 yen (Green)\n Child: 55,000 yen (Green)\n\n21-Day Japan Rail Pass\n\n Adult: 100,000 yen\n Child: 50,000 yen\n Adult: 140,000 yen (Green)\n Child: 70,000 yen (Green)\n\nHere’s the previous pricing for the Japan Rail Pass that was valid from 1989 to 2023:\n\n7-Day Japan Rail Pass\n\n Adult: 29,650 yen\n Child: 14,820 yen\n Adult: 39,600 yen (Green)\n Child: 19,800 yen (Green)\n\n14-Day Japan Rail Pass\n\n Adult: 47,250 yen\n Child: 23,620 yen\n Adult: 64,120 yen (Green)\n Child: 32,600 yen (Green)\n\n21-Day Japan Rail Pass\n\n Adult: 60,450 yen\n Child: 30,220 yen\n Adult: 83,390 yen (Green)\n Child: 41,690 yen (Green)\n\n2. Is the JR Pass Worth it in 2025? When to Use the Whole Japan Rail Pass\n   URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hsrZpVYH-ls\n   and back again to Tokyo. However, the price of the JR Pass skyrocketed by 70% in October of 2023. The \ncurrent prices for the ordinary JR Pass are 7-day 50,000 Yen, 14-day 80,000 Yen, 21-day 100,000 \nYen. The Green JR Pass costs 7-day 70,000 Yen, 14-day 110,000 Yen, 21-day 140,000 Yen. JR Passes \nfor children ages 6 to 11 years old cost half that of adult prices. For children 12 years and up \nthey pay the full adult price. Children ages 5 years and younger are free, up to two children \nper paying adult. The JR Pass is most helpful for long-distance Shinkansen rides. While a \nJR Pass covers both Shinkansen trains as well as local trains and buses, it is most helpful for \nthe portion of your trip where you will take long distance Shinkansen trains. This is because [...] or take the ferry to Busan South Korea, although that ferry is not included in the JR Pass. Let's \nexpand upon that previous example into a 14-day trip. This itinerary will start in Tokyo and end \nin Tokyo. From Tokyo head south to the Kansai area where you enjoy Osaka, Kyoto, and Nara and \nthen continue on south. Tokyo, Kyoto, Shin-Osaka, Himeji, Hiroshima, Miyajima Island, Kagoshima, \nBeppu, Hakata, Tokyo. Now you're starting to see even larger savings. It would cost 97,700 Yen \nfor individual tickets versus 80,000 Yen for a 14-day JR Pass. Now let's add in Nagoya so you \ncan visit Ghibli Park, which we highly recommend. Now the cost of individual train tickets would be \neven more. The total would be 104,700 Yen. That's versus 80,000 Yen for a 14-day pass or 100,000 [...] so you will save money by buying the 7-Day JR Pass at 50,000 Yen. And we have a video explaining \nthat itinerary. Now here's an example of a one-way route where it's worth it to use the JR Pass. You \narrive at Kansai Airport in Osaka and spend a few days enjoying the Konsai area. For this portion \nof your trip you could simply use an IC card (an ICOCA card) for local transportation among Osaka, \nKyoto, Nara. Then activate your 7-Day JR Pass on the day you leave Osaka. You will have time to \nspend one or two nights in these various places along the way. Shin-Osaka, Himeji, Hiroshima, \nMiyajima Island, Kagoshima, Beppu, Hakata. The total cost of individual tickets is 54,990 Yen \nso it would be a cost savings to get the JR Pass. Then you can either fly home from Fukuoka\n\n3. Japan Rail Pass Prices 2026: Official Price List (7, 14 & 21 ...\n   URL: https://selfguidejapan.com/blog/japan-rail-pass-price-2026\n   The 2026 nationwide Japan Rail Pass costs ¥50,000 for 7 days, ¥80,000 for 14 days, and ¥100,000 for 21 days in Ordinary class. Green Car versions sit higher. JR Group announced that prices for the nationwide Japan Rail Pass will be increasing as of October 1, 2026 — but only through overseas channels, and the official site is expected to hold pre-October pricing for a limited window.\n\nSo, is the JR Pass worth it for your trip? Honestly, for most travelers in 2026, it's not the automatic buy it used to be. This guide breaks down the current numbers, who actually saves money with the pass, the regional alternatives that quietly became smarter buys, and how to translate all of this into a real itinerary you can book.\n\n### Quick Answer: Should You Buy the JR Pass for 2026? [...] | Pass Duration | Ordinary (Adult) | Green Car (Adult) |\n --- \n| 7 days | ¥50,000 | ¥70,000 |\n| 14 days | ¥80,000 | Higher in proportion — confirm on the official site |\n| 21 days | ¥100,000 | Higher in proportion — confirm on the official site |\n| Children (6–11) | Half the adult fare | Half the adult fare |\n\nHeads up: overseas agency purchases are scheduled to rise from October 1, 2026 — the 7-day Ordinary pass moves from ¥50,000 to ¥53,000 via overseas sales channels. Details below.\n\nGot your prices? Plug your route into our free JR Pass Calculator to see if it pays off for your route, or read Is the JR Pass worth it? for the full break-even analysis.\n\n### Ordinary Pass (Standard)\n\n 7 days: ¥50,000\n 14 days: ¥80,000\n 21 days: ¥100,000\n\n### Green Pass (First Class) [...] ### Want a route built around the right pass mix?\n\nOur self-guided itineraries bake the transport math right into the route. We tell you when the national JR Pass pays off, when to skip it, and which regional pass to grab for your specific cities. Plan it your way — without the spreadsheet anxiety.\n\n## FAQ\n\nHow much is the Japan Rail Pass in 2026?expand\\_more\n\nThe 2026 nationwide JR Pass costs ¥50,000 for 7 days, ¥80,000 for 14 days, and ¥100,000 for 21 days in Ordinary class. Green Car versions start at ¥70,000 for 7 days.\n\nWill JR Pass prices change in 2026?expand\\_more\n\n4. JR to Increase Rail Pass Prices From October - Transport - Japan Travel\n   URL: https://en.japantravel.com/news/jr-to-increase-rail-pass-prices-from-october/72518\n   The change comes alongside fare revisions across several operators, including JR East, JR Hokkaido, JR West, and JR Kyushu. Overall, adult passes will increase by around 5 to 6 percent.\n\nFor many travelers, the Rail Pass is often part of the early planning stage of a Japan trip. It's commonly used for itineraries that link cities like Tokyo, Osaka, Kyoto, and Hiroshima, offering a simple way to move between regions without needing to calculate individual fares along the way.\n\nAfter the update, a 7-day standard pass will jump from 50,000 to 53,000 JPY, while the Green Class option will increase from 70,000 to 74,000 JPY. [...] JapanTravelen.japantravel.com/news/jr-to-increase-rail-pass-prices-from-october/72518\n\nJR to Increase Rail Pass Prices From October\n\n Transportation\n\nTransportation\n\nPhoto: Ricky LK / Unsplash\n\nPhoto: Ricky LK / Unsplash\n\n- 2 min read\n\n# JR to Increase Rail Pass Prices From October\n\nIt marks the first price hike since 2023\n\nKim Bergström\n\nBy\n\nJapan Travel Staff\n\nOne of the easiest and most popular ways to get around Japan is by train, especially for those planning to cover multiple regions in a single trip. However, from October 1st it's set to get a little more expensive, with the Japan Rail Pass increasing in price for the first time in three years. [...] The pass still tends to work best for those covering longer distances or taking multi-city trips, so its value really depends on how you plan to travel. If you're visiting later in the year, it may be worth taking the revised pricing into account when deciding whether it fits your itinerary.\n\nFor more information on the Japan Rail Pass, please visit our comprehensive guide here, or the official Japan Rail Pass online reservation site.\n\nWas this article helpful?\n\nHelp us improve the site\n\n## By Kim Bergström\n\nJapan Travel Staff\n\n### Information\n\nnikkei.com\n\nJapanTravel Tours\n\nJapan Pottery Tour: Hands-On Workshops & Artisan Encounters\n\nTour DatesNov 2026 & Feb 2027\n\nPrice$5,687~\n\n### Japan Pottery Tour: Hands-On Workshops & Artisan Encounters\n\n5. Japan Rail Pass Price - Tickets and Discounts | JRailPass\n   URL: https://www.jrailpass.com/prices\n   7 DaysAdult\n\n0\n\n14 daysAdult\n\n0\n\n21 daysAdult\n\n0\n\nSee prices for children ( ages 6 - 11 )\n\nHow much is a JR Pass? Check the prices for adults and children, for 7, 14 or 21 days, and for a Standard or Green Pass.\n\nJRailPass.com  Japan Rail Pass \n\nPrices\n\nSelect the class you wish to travel in, the number of accompanying children (if applicable) and enter the duration of your stay. It's that simple, so order your Japan Rail Pass today and get packing!\n\n|  |\n\n| JR Pass Prices |\n| GREEN PASS | STANDARD |\n| DURATION | ADULT | CHILD | ADULT | CHILD |\n| 7 days | ¥ 70,000 | ¥ 35,000 | ¥ 50,000 | ¥ 35,000 |\n| 14 days | ¥ 110,000 | ¥ 55,000 | ¥ 80,000 | ¥ 40,000 |\n| 21 days | ¥ 140,000 | ¥ 70,000 | ¥ 100,000 | ¥ 50,000 |\n\nChildren's discount [...] A 7-day JR Pass can allow you to travel to the most popular Japanese destinations (Tokyo, Kyoto, Osaka, etc.) and use local transport for less than buying each ticket separately. If you're planning several long-distance journeys, the JR Pass will save you money.\n\nJR Pass holders will also be able to enjoy discounts at some of Japan's popular tourist attractions.\n\nValidity\n\n## Validity of the JR Pass\n\nRemember that your pass is valid for either 7, 14 or 21 consecutive days. Once activated, the dates cannot be changed, which means you should always coordinate your vacation plans with the validity of the pass.\n\nprices\n\n## Children's discount [...] Your JR tickets Just a click away\n\nBook Now\n\nThe company Japan Rail Pass is an authorized distributor of the Japan Rail Pass. We are not part of the Japan Railways Group (JR).\n\n+34 93 547 88 66 » Mon-Fri 8 am to 8 pm (GMT+1)\n\ninfo@jrailpass.com » 24/7\n\nInternet Access\n\n Pocket WiFi\n eSIM\n SIM Card\n\nJapan Travel Info\n\n Shinkansen Bullet Trains\n Maps\n Buses\n\nRegional Passes\n\n Kansai-Hiroshima Area Pass\n Hokuriku Arch Pass\n Sanyo-San'in Northern Kyushu Pass\n Sanyo-San'in Area Pass\n Kansai Wide Area Pass\n JR East-South Hokkaido Rail Pass\n Takayama-Hokuriku Area Tourist Pass\n Explore All Passes\n\nJapan Rail Pass\n\n Green Pass\n Prices\n Delivery\n\nJapan Rail Pass\n\n# Japan Rail Pass price\n\nStandard\n\nGreen Pass First Class\n\n7 DaysAdult\n\n0\n\n14 daysAdult\n\n0\n\n21 daysAdult\n\n0", name='search_travel_info', id='13999c6e-9f42-495a-b198-c81748e1eb5f', tool_call_id='call_00_WlzoPMuPbIxoBAeIzNhF3674'),
                                             ToolMessage(content='1. 【东京到京都机票】_特价东京到京都飞机票价格查询_预订_去哪儿网Qunar.com\n   URL: https://flight.qunar.com/touch/international-routes-TYO-UKY.html\n   机票特价国际机票日本机票京都机票\n\n# 东京到京都机票\n\n东京到京都今天暂无报价，建议返回首页查询或预约东京到京都机票\n\n### 京都周边特价飞机票\n\n更多\n\n 曼谷\n 普吉\n 首尔\n 济州岛\n 吉隆坡\n 哥打基纳巴卢\n 巴厘岛\n 雅加达\n 金边\n 暹粒\n 河内\n 胡志明市\n 马尼拉\n 卡提克兰\n 加德满都\n 博克拉\n 马累\n 甘岛\n 科伦坡\n 贾夫纳\n 迪拜\n 阿布扎比\n 仰光\n 曼德勒\n\n### 东京到京都相关机票\n\n 佐贺到喜界岛\n 南大东到福冈\n 八户到札幌\n 对马岛到名古屋\n 南大东到喜界岛\n 名古屋到东京\n 旭川到名古屋\n 大阪到鹿儿岛\n 喜界岛到仙台\n 奥基岛到东京\n 大阪到奥基岛\n 广岛到奥基岛\n 花卷到冲绳\n 广岛到丰冈\n 福冈到对马岛\n 福冈到东京\n 广岛到松本\n 广岛到天草\n 新泻到南大东\n 冲绳到八户\n 佐贺到西之表\n 旭川到八户\n 丰冈到对马岛\n 大阪到西之表\n 对马岛到仙台\n 札幌到奥基岛\n 广岛到新泻\n 冲绳到大阪\n 南大东到札幌\n 广岛到对马岛\n\n去哪儿网（Qunar.com）提供特价国际机票查询，包含港澳台特价国际飞机票，东南亚特价国际飞机票，日韩特价国际机票，还有更多欧美等热门出境机票，国际城市特价机票，国际航空公司机票，全球国际机场提前订往返国际机票享更多特惠，全网最低价，支付安全，售后无忧，“去哪儿，都放心”。\n\n2. 日本十天自由行 - 日本游记攻略【携程攻略】\n   URL: https://you.ctrip.com/travels/japan100041/4140993.html\n   s社里类似于牌坊的这个建筑叫鸟居，由信奉者或商社等组织捐供，稻荷大社门外的这个鸟居是由丰臣秀吉捐供\n\n\n\n\n\n大社里面的主体建筑全是一片红色\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\ns社主殿后面密集的朱红色“千本鸟居”，是京都最具代表性的景观\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n成百上千座的朱红色鸟居构成了一条通往稻荷山山顶的通道\n\n\n\n\n\n走进千本鸟居，褪色的暗红色牌坊和光鲜亮丽的朱红色牌坊密集地交织在一起，透过阳光的照射显得格外壮观迷人，给人视觉上的震撼。\n\n\n\n\n\n稻荷半山看落日\n\n\n\n下山路上稻荷大社旁的观音塑像\n\n\n\n鸟居夕照\n\n\n\n第七日：京都、京都--东京  \n1、二条城  \n首先是二条城这个名字好奇怪，让人联想到中国麻将的二条。  \n实际上二条城是幕府将军在京都的行辕。二条城建于公元1603年，是由德川家康下令修建，是江户幕府的权力象征。\n\n二条城的大门\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n第二个门，雕刻精美极尽奢华，和中国古建筑的龙凤呈祥不同，这儿雕刻的是龙与仙鹤\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n二之丸御殿：日本的国宝级文物，被列入世界文化遗产，原汁原味的全木古建筑，进去需要脱鞋，里面不能拍照。里面的木结构建筑历经四百多年依然完好，只是外围的木柱已经被风吹蚀出深深的刻痕。\n\n\n\n\n\n具有中式建筑风格的清流园\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n城墙和护城河\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n本丸御殿庭园更是经典的中式建筑\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n2、京都--东京  \n在日本由铁路出行的确很便捷，京都到东京的车次很多，五百多公里的长途也不用提前购买车票，如果坐自由席车厢，直接进站等候几分钟就能出发，需要指定席车厢候车时间最多也就二十多分钟。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n途中快照，富士山惊鸿一现\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n我们住池袋王子酒店，东京站转JR山手线，按照导航指引在大冢站下车需步行1km，正确路线应该是在池袋站下车，步行只有六百多公尺，看来导航有时也不准确。 [...] 因为行程变动，增加了从东京到大阪的铁路里程，立刻在网上购买了高铁通票。\n\n3、必备物品：移动wi-fi，充电器等，这次我们还带了一个翻译棒，多少可以起一点作用。\n\n第一天：到达日本，住横滨\n\n\n\n\n\n1、东京成田机场：飞机上要发两个入境需要填报的清单，一个入境审查使用，一个取完行李出机场时使用，自由行的需要自己填写，我们在飞机上没有填第二张，结果是在现场填写，耽误了一些时间。\n\n2、使用JR PASS的第一步：在入境审查时记住要请审查官在护照上贴一个短期停留的标签，没有这个标签就换不了乘车用的JR PASS通票。\n\n3、机场—横滨：机场问询处有中文解答，帮助查询了从机场到横滨有直达的列车，购买的是指定席即有座位的车票，到横滨转地铁到新横滨。在新横滨车站问一个日本小伙怎样到地铁站，他还执意把我们带到有地铁指引牌的地方。晚上九点到达预定的酒店，从飞机落地到住进酒店一共3个多小时，还算非常顺利。\n\n夜晚：成田机场到横滨，列车驶过东京站之后，车厢里已是空空荡荡\n\n\n\n4、酒店：定的新横滨新横滨大和ROYNET酒店，离地铁出口200m左右，离JR新横滨站600m距离，价格不到500人民币，设施也还不错，在这里从新干线乘车到大阪最方便。\n\n用手机导航找路线\n\n横滨站—新横滨站：晚上八点过后，地铁里人还很多\n\n\n\n第二天：横滨、镰仓、新横滨—大阪，住大阪\n\n1、乘地铁到横滨站：地铁的自动购票机可以选择中文菜单，按照流程选择即可，自动购票机所有面值的纸币和硬币都能使用，很方便。 [...] 镰仓站站台\n\n\n\n站台上出售老字号产品的售货亭\n\n\n\n6、新横滨站—新大阪站\n\n日本的铁路系统建设得很好，班次多高效快捷，城际之间应该是最好的选择，不过价格比我们的高铁就贵多了，从新横滨到大阪500km东海道山阳新干线票价是14100日元（人民币约850元）；地铁和城市大巴起步价就是十多元人民币，以后再按行程增加票价；日本的出租车更贵，起步价2km660日元，以后每274m增加80日元，折合人民币就是每公里20元。\n\n\n\n到新大阪站的列车几分钟就有一班开出\n\n\n\n7、入住位于大阪站附近的大阪新阪急酒店：大阪有两个交通枢纽，分别是难波的新大阪站和梅田的大阪站，我们乘坐新干线到新大阪站再转地铁到大阪站。这个酒店位置比较好，负一层可以直通地铁站，但是房间较小，采用被单包裹一个类似于毛毯的老式方法作为被子，睡觉感觉很不舒服，这种方式国内基本上都淘汰了；其他设施都不错。\n\n第三天、奈良往返  \n1、交通：大阪到奈良非常方便，大阪站和新大阪站都有很多班次的JR列车，来去都用通票乘车，在奈良乘了一段公交，三站路230日元。  \n2、奈良：这里曾经是日本最早的都城，是一个有很多古老建筑的城市，特别是寺庙和神社众多，在佛教传入日本的公元6世纪至8世纪期间，奈良一直作为日本的政治、文化中心而繁荣。\n\n\n\n3、奈良公园  \n成群嬉戏于公园里的鹿，因与春日大社流传的白鹿传说有关而受到保护，这些鹿优雅又温顺，非常讨人喜欢\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n4、东大寺  \n东大寺已有一千多年的历史，唐朝高僧鉴真和尚曾在这里设坛授戒讲经说法。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n东大寺大佛殿，正面宽度57米，深50米，为世界最大的木造建筑。大佛殿内，放置着高15米以上的大佛像--卢舍那佛。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n寺庙外面偶遇表演团队\n\n\n\n\n\n5、春日大社\n\n3. 日本旅游攻略大全, 日本自助游攻略大全【携程旅游】\n   URL: http://vacations.ctrip.com/you/d-japan-100041\n   ## 日本热门线路推荐\n\n \n\n  ### 日本大阪+京都+奈良市6日5晚私家团·暑期FUN肆玩【点管家咨询定制行程•出行攻略•优惠券！自营爆品】<问客服即含流量卡>市区连住+环球含接送|全新环球迎新纪|奈良萌鹿&岚山小火车|N选1行程随心选<亲子暑期避暑游>\n \n\n  ### 日本东京+大阪+京都+奈良市+富士山6日5晚跟团游·暑期纯玩送签证WiFi AC线东航&国航+升1晚5钻+全餐+3晚温泉+蟹道乐 B线东阪各1天自由\n \n\n  ### 日本东京+富士山+大阪+京都+奈良市7日6晚拼小团·『携程自营』赠700元新干线 |环球影城|可选和服体验|赏本州风光|奈良小鹿|富士山雪顶\n \n\n  ### 日本大阪+京都5日4晚私家团·『环球影城1日券·初游推荐』岚山小火车&奈良公园喂鹿|大阪城天守阁&永观堂&南禅寺水路阁&金阁寺&清水寺&伏见稻荷大社|1晚京都|特色鳗鱼午餐&绿牌车安全出行「咨询管家定制行程」\n \n\n  ### 日本大阪+东京7日6晚私家团·全程仅换住1次【一次玩够！ 联系我们领双重优惠】关东关西双城记&景点黄金配比游|3N大阪+3N东京<华人老司机带玩·N种玩法>邂逅清水寺&富士山雪顶&东京塔望远|赠新干线初体验\n \n\n  ### 日本东京+富士山+京都